# sys-gym-hearthome (docs/research/gym-puzzles.md): Hearthome Gym's dark
# rooms. Entering a trainer room draws its correct door and clue tile from the game's main stream; the replay
# pins that stream (`set state rng`) so the draw is the same on every run seed, and pins the game seed (`set
# state seed`) so the wandering trainers walk the same way. Room 1: both trainers are battled where they spot
# the player (also by the player facing them) or by talking; the draw survives a save round trip; a wrong door
# (circle) leads back to the entrance facing south and clears the slot; coming back draws again (triangle);
# room 2's four trainers, then the star door to Fantina.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_TYRANITAR 70 platinum:MOVE_CRUNCH
set state seed 4242
set state rng {"seed": 7}
set var platinum:VAR_HAS_ENTERED_HEARTHOME_GYM_BEFORE 1
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_HEARTHOME_CITY_GYM_ENTRANCE_ROOM 4 3 up
until idle
+0 press up
until state player.zone "platinum:MAP_HEADER_HEARTHOME_CITY_GYM_TRAINER_ROOM_1"
+0 release up
until idle
+0 screenshot hearthome-dark
+0 press up
+1 release up
+10 release a
+0 press left
+1 release left
+4 release a
+0 press left
+1 release left
+10 release a
+0 press left
+1 release left
+10 release a
+0 press left
+1 release left
+10 release a
+0 press up
+1 release up
+4 release a
until message 300
advance text
battle auto 20000
advance text
until idle
